              "@type": "Question",
              "name": "When would I need a crown instead?",
              "acceptedAnswer": {
                "@type": "Answer",
                "text": "A crown may be recommended when the tooth is cracked, heavily weakened, root canal-treated, or missing too much structure for a partial restoration."
